#==============================================================================================
#
#   text_paintable - Painting::TextPaintable: the paintable of a text node
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/Painting/TextPaintable.cpp (lines 1-35) and TextPaintable.h: a text
#       node's paintable (its text is painted by the PaintableWithLines that holds its
#       fragments) and its inspector overlay, which highlights those fragments.
